{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 2, "text": "弓”、“念团山经”等几个阶段。第一阶段是查访野兽藏身之地，查出后，猎人需先向该地", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 253, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "弓”、“念团山经”等几个阶段。第一阶段是查访野兽藏身之地，查出后，猎人需先向该地", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 253, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 3, "text": "寨老交涉，获准后方可进行捕猎。准备阶段，猎人先在方圆五里之外的四周插上木牌，告", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 318, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "寨老交涉，获准后方可进行捕猎。准备阶段，猎人先在方圆五里之外的四周插上木牌，告", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 318, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 4, "text": "之过路人注意安全。七天后猎人才进山。当经验丰富的猎手身背弓弩和毒箭进山，准确", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 378, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "之过路人注意安全。七天后猎人才进山。当经验丰富的猎手身背弓弩和毒箭进山，准确", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 378, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 5, "text": "地判定野兽常走的路径后，即在路旁草丛约三尺处架设弓弩等待猎物。弩机用细麻线拴", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 443, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地判定野兽常走的路径后，即在路旁草丛约三尺处架设弓弩等待猎物。弩机用细麻线拴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 443, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 6, "text": "住从路中穿过，当野兽路过绊着麻绳带动弩机，毒箭自动射出，击中野兽。架完弓弩，猎", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 515, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "住从路中穿过，当野兽路过绊着麻绳带动弩机，毒箭自动射出，击中野兽。架完弓弩，猎", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 515, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 7, "text": "人即念诵一种捕猎虎、豹的“团山经”（咒语）。“团山经”分“请进经”和“放出经”。先念", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 571, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "人即念诵一种捕猎虎、豹的“团山经”（咒语）。“团山经”分“请进经”和“放出经”。先念", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 571, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 8, "text": "“请进经”", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 640, "w": 181, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“请进经”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 640, "w": 181, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 9, "text": "，捕获野兽后再念“放出经”。据说猎人念“团山经”后引起虎豹的痛恨，防虎", "bbox_px": {"x": 277, "y": 640, "w": 1383, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，捕获野兽后再念“放出经”。据说猎人念“团山经”后引起虎豹的痛恨，防虎", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 277, "y": 640, "w": 1383, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 10, "text": "豹报复袭击，夜里猎人居住的人家需加倍提防。被念过“团山经”的虎豹都是边走边叫，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 704, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "豹报复袭击，夜里猎人居住的人家需加倍提防。被念过“团山经”的虎豹都是边走边叫，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 704, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 11, "text": "当叫声突然停止，说明其已被毒箭射中。虎豹都在太阳落山后才出来走动，所以天亮后", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 772, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "当叫声突然停止，说明其已被毒箭射中。虎豹都在太阳落山后才出来走动，所以天亮后", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 772, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 12, "text": "需撒掉弓弩，以免误伤人畜。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 837, "w": 494, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "需撒掉弓弩，以免误伤人畜。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 837, "w": 494, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 13, "text": "猎获的老虎不能抬进家中，需在院里摆酒、米、饭等祭山神，才能剥老虎皮。念“放山", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 897, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "猎获的老虎不能抬进家中，需在院里摆酒、米、饭等祭山神，才能剥老虎皮。念“放山", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 897, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 14, "text": "经”的意思是放掉虎豹。虽同一地方还有多只虎豹，也不能再捕猎第二只，必须换到新的", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 966, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经”的意思是放掉虎豹。虽同一地方还有多只虎豹，也不能再捕猎第二只，必须换到新的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 966, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 15, "text": "地方，重新念诵“团山经”，才能进行第二次捕获。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1026, "w": 848, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地方，重新念诵“团山经”，才能进行第二次捕获。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1026, "w": 848, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 16, "text": "“中硐煤山”的猎人不用弓弩，只用火药枪和猎狗。猎人结伴行动，推技术好者为首", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1089, "w": 1464, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“中硐煤山”的猎人不用弓弩，只用火药枪和猎狗。猎人结伴行动，推技术好者为首", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1089, "w": 1464, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 17, "text": "领负责指挥。上山打猎需选择吉日。吉日天未亮，就起床吃饭。饭前在家中火塘边点三", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "领负责指挥。上山打猎需选择吉日。吉日天未亮，就起床吃饭。饭前在家中火塘边点三", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 18, "text": "炷香，烧化纸钱，念诵咒语。吃完饭，趁全寨人未起床即出寨上山。上山后，往往在山上", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1227, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "炷香，烧化纸钱，念诵咒语。吃完饭，趁全寨人未起床即出寨上山。上山后，往往在山上", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1227, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 19, "text": "连住几天。在狩猎期间，若遇“流连”日和“空亡”日（凶日），猎人们即使发现野兔也不能", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1287, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "连住几天。在狩猎期间，若遇“流连”日和“空亡”日（凶日），猎人们即使发现野兔也不能", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1287, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 20, "text": "开枪。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1356, "w": 105, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "开枪。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1356, "w": 105, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 21, "text": "寻找到野兽踪迹后，猎人也不立即出击，而是坐下来先抽袋烟，养精蓄锐，之后才开", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1420, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "寻找到野兽踪迹后，猎人也不立即出击，而是坐下来先抽袋烟，养精蓄锐，之后才开", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1420, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 22, "text": "始猎捕。如果被猎获的动物是野猪，只准放在院坝里，不能抬进家。烧开水脱掉猪毛后，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1485, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "始猎捕。如果被猎获的动物是野猪，只准放在院坝里，不能抬进家。烧开水脱掉猪毛后，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1485, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 23, "text": "先割下野猪头祭供山神，再将野猪肉抬进家。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1549, "w": 780, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "先割下野猪头祭供山神，再将野猪肉抬进家。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1549, "w": 780, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 24, "text": "在“中硐煤山”猎人群体中，谁成为首领后要遵循一系列传统规约。他每年正月初一", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1609, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在“中硐煤山”猎人群体中，谁成为首领后要遵循一系列传统规约。他每年正月初一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 1609, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 25, "text": "要杀一只公鸡祭祀山神，祈求山神在新的一年保佑获更多猎物。祭祀时不拔毛，只需用", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1678, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "要杀一只公鸡祭祀山神，祈求山神在新的一年保佑获更多猎物。祭祀时不拔毛，只需用", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1678, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 26, "text": "火种将鸡毛烧出气味，山神即可领受。每次捕获到野猪后首领可分到野猪头。这个野猪", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1742, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "火种将鸡毛烧出气味，山神即可领受。每次捕获到野猪后首领可分到野猪头。这个野猪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1742, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 27, "text": "头不能砍碎，要放在锅中将肉全部煮烂后用手扒出来，头骨架则整个挂在首领家屋檐下，", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1806, "w": 1556, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "头不能砍碎，要放在锅中将肉全部煮烂后用手扒出来，头骨架则整个挂在首领家屋檐下，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1806, "w": 1556, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 28, "text": "挂的数量越多，显出他本领越大。猎手们认，如果用刀切野猪头肉，下次打猎时猎人和", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1871, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "挂的数量越多，显出他本领越大。猎手们认，如果用刀切野猪头肉，下次打猎时猎人和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1871, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 29, "text": "猎狗会受重伤。", "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 1934, "w": 274, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "猎狗会受重伤。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 1934, "w": 274, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 30, "text": "如果一个人从年轻时就开始打猎并担任了首领，到中年或老年时不想打猎了，要举", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 2004, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "如果一个人从年轻时就开始打猎并担任了首领，到中年或老年时不想打猎了，要举", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 2004, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 187, "line_no": 31, "text": "行“交班”仪式，当着众徒弟的面宣布不再打猎，并在众徒弟中指定一人作为新的首领。", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2064, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "行“交班”仪式，当着众徒弟的面宣布不再打猎，并在众徒弟中指定一人作为新的首领。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 2064, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
